manipulation_ws/src/
├── manipulation_pkg/
│   ├── robot_config.py       — all constants (poses, joint angles, collision boxes, tuning params)
│   ├── planner.py            — MoveIt2 interface (move_joints, move_cartesian, gripper calls, TF, collision scene)
│   ├── executor.py           — pick and place sequence (step-by-step logic)
│   └── planner_node.py       — ROS2 node entry point (trigger service, threading)
├── gripper_pkg/
│   ├── gripper_node.py       — ROS2 gripper bridge (exposes /gripper/open and /gripper/close services)
│   └── arduino/
│       └── OpenRB_modbusRTU/
│           └── OpenRB_modbusRTU.ino  — Arduino firmware (Modbus RTU slave, Dynamixel control)
└── robot_bringup/
    ├── launch/
    │   └── full_system.launch.py     — launches everything together
    └── config/
        └── robot_params.yaml         — runtime parameters (robot IP, etc.)


Communication flow:
/planner/trigger (std_srvs/Trigger)
        ↓
planner_node.py  (ManipulationPlannerNode)
        ↓
executor.py  (PickAndPlaceExecutor.run())
        ↓
planner.py  (Planner)
        ↓ joint/cartesian moves          ↓ gripper
/move_action (MoveGroup)         /gripper/open|close (Trigger)
        ↓                                ↓
  move_group                      gripper_node.py
        ↓                                ↓
  xarm7 hardware                  xarm SDK (XArmAPI)
                                         ↓
                                  RS485 tool cable
                                         ↓
                                  OpenRB-150 (Modbus RTU)
                                         ↓
                                  XL330 Dynamixel servo


Step sequence (executor.py):
Step 1   — move_joints(PRE_GRASP_JOINTS_DEG)        OMPL joint space
Step 1.5 — get_current_eef_pose()                   TF lookup
Step 2   — open_gripper()                           Modbus RS485
Step 2.5 — move_cartesian(align_pose, Pilz PTP)     orientation align
Step 3   — move_cartesian(grasp_pose, Pilz PTP)     grasp approach
Step 4   — close_gripper()                          Modbus RS485
Step 5   — move_cartesian(lift_pose,  Pilz PTP)     lift
Step 6   — move_joints(DROP_JOINTS_DEG)             OMPL joint space
Step 7   — open_gripper()                           Modbus RS485
